#: ../../source/reference/index.md:3
msgid ""
"This is the **topic** axis of the documentation: audience-independent, "
"complete, and the place every guide points at rather than repeating. A "
"page here answers *what does this do*, for every option and every "
"setting, without caring who is asking or what they are trying to achieve."
msgstr ""

