#: ../../source/reference/index.md:32
msgid "Two things to know about this column"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/index.md:33
msgid ""
"**A reference page does not advise.** It says what an option does and "
"stops. \"Which of these do I want\" is answered in the guide you came "
"from — deliberately, because the answer differs by reader and the option "
"does not."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/index.md:37
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**The validation pages are not editable prose.** They are content-"
"addressed: their hashes are recorded in signed grants, here and in other "
"repositories, and their published URLs are what those grants resolve. "
"Correcting a typo in one invalidates every grant that cites it. See "
"{doc}`../guides/institutional/why-trust-a-grant`."
msgstr ""

